E0005 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0005)

  x unary `-` expects a signed integer type but found `u32`
   ,-[test.star:2:19]
 1 | fn test() {
 2 |     let x: u32 = -(2 + 3);
   :                   ^^^|^^^
   :                      `-- cannot negate unsigned type `u32`
 3 | }
   `----
